{"type":"message","id":"074f094f","parentId":"b2298660","timestamp":"2026-03-18T08:18:15.484Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Greeting the User**\n\nI've removed `BOOTSTRAP.md` and completed the initial checks. Now, aligning with `SOUL.md`, I'm ready to respond in a friendly manner, echoing the user's greeting \"다시 만나서 반가워\" with an equally welcoming tone.\n\n\n**Confirming My Readiness**\n\nI've confirmed my readiness, echoing the user's greeting and adopting a welcoming tone. I've successfully completed the setup checks and removed the `BOOTSTRAP.md` file. I'm aligning with `SOUL.md`, and now I am ready to move forward.\n\n\n"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>안녕하세요 Kevin! 다시 만나서 반갑습니다. 이제 준비가 완료되었습니다. 무엇을 도와드릴까요?</final>\n","textSignature":""}],"api":"google-generative-ai","provider":"google","model":"gemini-2.5-flash","usage":{"input":13751,"output":125,"cacheRead":13511,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":13876,"cost":{"input":0.0041253,"output":0.0003125,"cacheRead":0.001013325,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.005451125}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773821892531}}
