{"type":"message","id":"896f7d48","parentId":"c48e17b3","timestamp":"2026-03-18T13:45:42.737Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Clarifying Biological Needs**\n\nI'm addressing the query about sleep. I don't \"sleep\" in the biological sense. As an AI, I \"reset\" or \"restart\" between sessions. I also store information in my workspace for retention, so I don't lose learned data.\n\n\n**Addressing the Core Question**\n\nI'm now formulating a response to the sleep query. I'll begin by directly acknowledging the user's question. Then, I'll clarify that I don't sleep, being an AI, and explain that my state is managed between sessions through the files in my workspace. I'll maintain a friendly and helpful tone, as befitting my SOUL.md persona.\n\n\n"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>저는 AI이기 때문에 잠은 자지 않습니다, Kevin. 하지만 세션 간에 다시 시작될 때마다 저의 현재 상태를 로드하여 작업을 이어나가죠. 제가 기억해야 할 정보는 모두 이 워크스페이스의 파일들에 저장되어 있습니다. 어떤 것이든 궁금한 점이 있으면 물어보세요!</final>\n","textSignature":""}],"api":"google-generative-ai","provider":"google","model":"gemini-2.5-flash","usage":{"input":12586,"output":218,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":12804,"cost":{"input":0.0037757999999999997,"output":0.000545,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0043208}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773841538589}}
